# Plaxtar Designer — keep the JSON design trees + <screen>.flow.json position sidecars;
# ignore regenerable artifacts: screenshots and the generated AGENTS.md codegen guide
# (a copy of docs/plaxtar-codegen.md, re-emitted on every /_catalog/export).
# For a custom output folder (PlaxtarDesignerOptions.DesignsPath, e.g. .plaxtar-designs),
# mirror these two lines under that folder.
designs/*.png
designs/AGENTS.md

